[{"title":"赠姚梦峡","author":"释函是","text":"世乱方知道，遐心滞草庐。\n欲明今日事，莫误古人书。\n独坐疏钟外，相携寒月初。\n身名殊可已，鉴此百年馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43900,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送商丘伯侯若孩扶柩归中州","author":"释函是","text":"子有君与母，死别复生离。\n寒月空相照，白云殊未知。\n驱车出庾岭，归里正秋期。\n望望商丘路，徘徊系所思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43901,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"因侯若孩寄匡山蠡云","author":"释函是","text":"十载匡山梦，因君寄短吟。\n为停彭蠡楫，一讯虎溪音。\n塔影千岩出，松关积雪深。\n寒灰犹可拨，欲避俗人寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43902,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人入匡山","author":"释函是","text":"我有匡庐约，君先问落星。\n十年松树火，此日石头形。\n梦入溪声细，桥分山色青。\n为言林下叟，出岁返蓬扃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43903,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"姚梦峡生日戏赠","author":"释函是","text":"三十四年前，当知亦偶然。\n胡为于此日，更欲贺初年。\n雁过长空澹，江摇寒日圆。\n一生魂梦里，荣落在谁边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43904,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一月三十夜","author":"释函是","text":"明朝又腊月，因病觉时过。\n祖意逢人少，青山去日多。\n亮公曾有约，瓒老定如何。\n早岁深云志，而今鬓渐皤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43905,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦怀止言澹归诸衲","author":"释函是","text":"念子远行役，况复上元时。\n灯火何方照，川原此夕思。\n柳风吹客袂，春月映山池。\n夜永寒云重，应怜江雪迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43906,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孤松和诸子作因忆归宗复生松","author":"释函是","text":"寒影敛幽壑，涛声响万山。\n一株非我意，孤韵共人閒。\n干入春云里，枝横夜月间。\n鹤巢应未改，犹待老僧还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43907,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶叹","author":"释函是","text":"近海山犹浅，平林春尚寒。\n一从淇水北，五见梅花残。\n自好终无术，因人亦复难。\n旧居匡岳麓，时向望中欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43908,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻转一讣","author":"释函是","text":"肺病知难待，终伤朝露情。\n形骸一日重，海岳百年轻。\n月落梅花夜，云寒竹叶坪。\n横梁与孤屿，徒有昔人名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43909,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻采石讣","author":"释函是","text":"花发当朝露，莺啼怯暮春。\n谁怜老病日，恸哭少年人。\n薄虑频经乱，移忧岂厌贫。\n虽馀诸梵侣，亦复渐相沦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43910,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻范华宇治圃却寄","author":"释函是","text":"于世复何事，随时学种园。\n一身馀草泽，八口待辕门。\n城柳移畦影，春禽啄月痕。\n相思聊以寄，寒暖不堪论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43911,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送山品台设领诸衲上华首","author":"释函是","text":"三老潮头暗，百花春后明。\n莫频回首处，遥慰故山情。\n离乱田庄旧，辛勤手足轻。\n吾门多乐事，不是畏时名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43912,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萤火","author":"释函是","text":"尚尔微明志，遐心共隐沦。\n昏霾应自见，白日畏投人。\n春草独行处，禅房閒坐身。\n高低怜羽短，曾不却迷津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43913,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"分粥与饥者","author":"释函是","text":"戎马嗟何已，秋田苦未登。\n井闾无少壮，贫病绝亲朋。\n笑我生方拙，怜人强不能。\n一瓢分众粥，惭愧远投僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43914,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"离欲为众乞食","author":"释函是","text":"山浅松花少，枝危鹤影高。\n图将六月息，不爱一人劳。\n俯仰随双屦，风尘有敝袍。\n秋风初入户，迟尔返蓬蒿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43915,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"食荔子怀止言澹归","author":"释函是","text":"去年同擘荔，坐月板桥新。\n复见手中物，顿思江上人。\n紫霄朝暮石，京口去留津。\n一纸南安信，浮沉十二旬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43916,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得吼万琼州信","author":"释函是","text":"海外行人少，艰难远寄书。\n兵荒千里外，存殁九年馀。\n目尽无飞雁，天长只敝庐。\n徘徊山日下，一倍惜居诸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43917,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬王园长兄弟","author":"释函是","text":"羡尔难兄弟，烟云共此遐。\n心閒馀岁月，世乱苦桑麻。\n野寺门前路，石楼峰上霞。\n因君思旧隐，山色十年赊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43918,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"因乱奉母蕉林阿字频为省视感而赋诗","author":"释函是","text":"乱离惭我母，辛苦赖人将。\n影息秋畦近，钟鸣蕉叶长。\n山中一食暇，林外几家忙。\n因数振嚣俗，超然及上皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43919,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪桥古木为雨所仆戏示阿字","author":"释函是","text":"四时停热客，一雨叹离群。\n对月全无影，临风那复闻。\n根看仍屈曲，叶积故纷纭。\n物理此中得，荣枯岂足云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43920,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽英目青","author":"释函是","text":"山上曾来往，悄然生道心。\n去秋犹有约，此日竟难寻。\n草色青还白，溪流浅复深。\n伊人不可见，残月想微吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43921,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼目青却寄社中","author":"释函是","text":"忽闻高士讣，未免一长嗟。\n白社人难再，青山日易斜。\n此生如可托，何事欲离家。\n飒飒秋风起，应怜两鬓华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43922,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将出岭留别雷峰诸子","author":"释函是","text":"一别榕溪寺，萧然独杖藜。\n六年林磬渺，千里暮云低。\n山水何曾异，乡关各自迷。\n夜帆忘所向，恍惚隔溪西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43923,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留别华首诸子","author":"释函是","text":"避乱寻深处，遥空一别难。\n昔时相勉句，今日尽须看。\n便舫知何去，投人强作欢。\n北风吹暮雪，应念石门寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43924,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留别张梦回","author":"释函是","text":"惜别张居士，慇勤寄一言。\n干戈犹未已，瓢笠尚能存。\n山浅无黄独，林深有白猿。\n古今看欲尽，相待惟蓬门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43925,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留示吼万吼万期以九月至雷峰","author":"释函是","text":"君将从海发，我复向山归。\n去住一何定，佳期多所违。\n秋波风色急，寒月岭头稀。\n若到雷峰夕，怀人望翠微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43926,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"台阁滩怀时尽","author":"释函是","text":"旅病方思汝，衷怀未可论。\n所施惭所报，知己重酬恩。\n滩浅石流疾，秋高霜鬓繁。\n到山黄叶尽，寒夜感谁存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43927,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊韶石四更见月","author":"释函是","text":"山月出残夜，清波寒照人。\n推篷惟独坐，高咏孰为邻。\n塔影看何似，江声闻最亲。\n村鸡催曙色，烟棹又前津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43928,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病留凌江寺","author":"释函是","text":"避地思投老，征途复苦辛。\n古城寒戍火，多病老僧身。\n寂寂凌江寺，萧萧枫叶津。\n昨来云水客，云是庐山人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43929,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅病忆梁同庵","author":"释函是","text":"归山愁旅病，因病益怀人。\n寒日残流乱，秋风永夜真。\n此中无可语，他外只閒身。\n十日前来梦，庐山见欲亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43930,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韶阳道中病起适无侍者复病","author":"释函是","text":"我病差能饭，君行复被风。\n心悬千里切，途哭两人穷。\n忍冻推残絮，频兴候曙钟。\n青山岂易得，珍重百年中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43931,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度大庾岭","author":"释函是","text":"爱雪辞乡国，秋风送马蹄。\n庾关终古峙，猿狖至今啼。\n五老人初望，三山日渐西。\n徘徊下原隰，叠叠白云迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43932,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中被诘","author":"释函是","text":"问我何处去，拟归庐山岑。\n途艰多病衲，虑淡无机心。\n一钵陈年饭，数篇行路吟。\n生平颇自信，何事苦稽寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43933,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中忆止言澹归","author":"释函是","text":"匡山计日至，京口望人来。\n几时同到岸，扶我一登台。\n群雁惊风起，孤舟乘月开。\n章江寒色动，无那暮砧哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43934,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过十八滩二首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"世事当今日，时时十八滩。\n激流飘作雨，危石望成峦。\n牵缆烟波渺，随人出没宽。\n闻钟知近寺，翘首倚船栏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43935,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过十八滩二首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"漩澓无行径，波涛不忍看。\n舟穿叠石捷，篙放急流难。\n沙鸟立何意，渔人坐自安。\n诗成聊独咏，不觉夕阳残。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43936,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阻风宿险处","author":"释函是","text":"旅泊不知处，深村似有人。\n波涛殊未已，舟子益相亲。\n乾叶弄寒月，凄风吹夜燐。\n无心造物妒，辛苦隐山身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43937,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓过螺川","author":"释函是","text":"螺川寒日上，依旧照金牛。\n烟水流残磬，江风吹暮秋。\n战争虚岁月，存殁几交游。\n都是归山事，人间易白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43938,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中口号","author":"释函是","text":"湾湾江上水，直直渡头烟。\n烟散乌啼岸，水寒渔聚船。\n已过残邑里，未到好山川。\n欲慕东林远，高眠槐柳边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43939,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡江望匡山","author":"释函是","text":"停棹望匡岳，几非人世间。\n两月江中水，十年湖上山。\n风波行欲尽，岩壑终当还。\n沙鸥与松鹤，见我何时閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43940,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴城望匡山","author":"释函是","text":"十年归梦积，一望白云乡。\n山近江流缓，天空霜夜长。\n明朝彭蠡水，向夕古松堂。\n老大深为计，风波不可忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43941,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"到归宗怅止言澹归未至","author":"释函是","text":"匡山不易到，之子滞江城。\n更忆临岐话，难为旷别情。\n衲衣千缕薄，楖栗万山轻。\n多是少年事，风尘愧老成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43942,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"到匡两月叠闻梁同庵崔石师讣音","author":"释函是","text":"宿约成虚梦，初闻复自疑。\n益伤离别易，难免死生悲。\n夏木蝉声急，朝钟日影迟。\n暮年惟有隐，莫遣世人知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43943,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"顿修三决之镇江寄候月鹭兼促止言澹归诸子回山","author":"释函是","text":"闻君在京口，我已到匡庐。\n信息凭诸衲，寒温懒作书。\n风烟平溆浦，人物乱樵渔。\n空谷待归客，白云横太虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43944,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄止言澹归","author":"释函是","text":"有约今秋返，相携五老前。\n知尔南中苦，怜予海外偏。\n溪声僧梦稳，江色客心悬。\n且归就禅寂，休计买山钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43945,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与须识夜话","author":"释函是","text":"是非非我计，今古皆空名。\n肝胆尚须惜，胸怀岂易明。\n人心离复合，世事败还成。\n何似寒溪水，朝朝霜气清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43946,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同善邻须识游玉帘泉","author":"释函是","text":"归山不出户，初过玉帘泉。\n万壑危桥隐，一峰寒瀑悬。\n何人开石径，引我入云烟。\n最爱金轮近，閒携三两禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43947,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"促诸禅还山而渐侍者独返且有期予下山之约怪而示之","author":"释函是","text":"人间不可住，决意向栖贤。\n乞食从桥外，编茅傍水边。\n一生丘壑性，半世友生缘。\n怪尔还山后，相期话未圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43948,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对雪示诸子","author":"释函是","text":"万里溪无色，千峰影到栏。\n莫将银世界，空作月明看。\n开眼皆怜白，何人不畏寒。\n群公知此意，无复悔衣单。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43949,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初住栖贤口占","author":"释函是","text":"为爱匡庐僻，寻幽到峡桥。\n山围松树老，泉逐夜钟飘。\n午食蒸藜暖，朝锄乞种遥。\n茅居犹未缚，辛苦木铃摇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43950,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病二首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"此身原可厌，况复病相因。\n出入难如意，辛勤徒累人。\n形从衣里怯，山向窗中新。\n情境何曾定，低头祇自亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43951,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病二首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"万缘教散去，一衲且相依。\n身共水云淡，心随钟磬微。\n未须分彼此，无复计从违。\n语默二俱丧，人疑鲁祖机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43952,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高泉感赋","author":"释函是","text":"意重难为继，恩深每易谖。\n但知无限苦，只是不能言。\n放辱非吾事，沉沦有母存。\n一春风雨恶，愁倚杏花村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43953,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栖贤山居十首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"爱友寻山住，山深人未归。\n不知秋色暮，空见雁南飞。\n树密溪云重，峰高霜月微。\n夜来松火怯，独自理寒衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43954,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栖贤山居十首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"门前看五老，石上待三更。\n望月不知处，沿溪每独行。\n云开见雁影，泉远闻人声。\n莫讶无相顾，高情感易生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43955,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栖贤山居十首 其三","author":"释函是","text":"潦倒一枝筇，逍遥十里松。\n偶逢犊鼻叟，同听石溪钟。\n骤雨不出谷，晴云隐乱峰。\n忽然残照起，犹见金芙蓉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43956,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栖贤山居十首 其四","author":"释函是","text":"自笑吾生足，支藤上紫霄。\n松门山日近，野火石云烧。\n老母留芋供，邻僧隔水招。\n一声樵笛响，催我下峰腰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43957,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栖贤山居十首 其五","author":"释函是","text":"老病心逾澹，饥寒韵更偏。\n独怜山月外，无计秋风前。\n拾栗煨牛火，驱茅下麦田。\n明朝重九日，容易度残年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43958,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栖贤山居十首 其六","author":"释函是","text":"客到无留处，情乖懒见人。\n床头多病衲，殿角一閒身。\n夜色秋旻净，泉声晓梦真。\n昨闻江上信，又阻白门津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43959,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栖贤山居十首 其七","author":"释函是","text":"我自立溪上，水流何太忙。\n年年松树绿，日日峡桥长。\n林月窥岩户，山风压草堂。\n几人相对暇，熟炙橘皮汤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43960,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栖贤山居十首 其八","author":"释函是","text":"偶来枫树下，孤影息秋阴。\n涧浅摇清濑，风轻爽素襟。\n行人归竹远，散犊入林深。\n何处不相似，时时压此心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43961,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栖贤山居十首 其九","author":"释函是","text":"病骨怜秋夜，夜长不可眠。\n久疏芦菔味，惭愧白云禅。\n开户望霜月，随身过野田。\n晴空山势耸，一雁入寒烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43962,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栖贤山居十首 其十","author":"释函是","text":"山中常作梦，梦里不知山。\n双屦随人去，千门得食还。\n夜泉寒竹簟，秋月白柴关。\n同道如相忆，归来共学顽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43963,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸衲侍长庆老人扫博山塔诗以勉之二首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"乱山残雪后，病骨尚能支。\n乃祖思先泽，而师爱汝痴。\n春寒青黛草，烟煖白云芝。\n此道惟高隐，毋忘金井池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43964,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸衲侍长庆老人扫博山塔诗以勉之二首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"道衰知自贵，后死倍应难。\n微尚因人僻，能言为汝欢。\n隐甘三亩宅，贫忆半旬餐。\n未可辜先觉，层岩只耐寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43965,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送长庆老人先入岭南","author":"释函是","text":"不敢更言别，师行随后归。\n幢幡迁柳岸，童行返柴扉。\n云覆庾公岭，香迎荔子矶。\n到时应夏尽，秋气袭人衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43966,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓绍隆","author":"释函是","text":"偕隐寻深处，无缘遂半生。\n病同松鹤瘦，贫共雪山清。\n敛目常终日，横眠每四更。\n不知连夜雨，空有水流声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43967,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"解即觉寺事欲处以侍寮栖贤人至始知其行乞江北感而怀之作诗四首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"罢汝栖贤守，归余侍者寮。\n遽闻北地去，竟负南山招。\n积绪千言少，离忧一梦遥。\n更怜去秋事，零泪纸窗飘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43968,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]